  return `<section class="form-card"><div class="section-kicker">Hermes agent middleware</div><h2>Optional orchestration connector</h2><p class="subtle">This connector is separate from the existing Hermes WhatsApp bridge. Agent Platform remains responsible for project isolation, permissions, validation, persistence and WhatsApp delivery.</p><form id="hermes-middleware-settings-form" class="form-grid"><label class="field">Connector name<input name="name" value="${escape(value.name||'')}" placeholder="Local Hermes orchestrator" required></label><label class="field">Middleware service endpoint<input name="endpoint" type="url" value="${escape(value.endpoint||'')}" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:3010/execute" required></label><label class="field">Middleware API key / secret<input name="apiKey" type="password" placeholder="${value.hasApiKey?'Encrypted secret saved — leave blank to retain':'Enter secret'}"></label><label class="field">Default profile<input name="profile" value="${escape(value.profile||'')}" placeholder="construction-default"></label><label class="field">Connection timeout (seconds)<input name="timeoutSeconds" type="number" min="5" max="600" value="${escape(value.timeoutSeconds||90)}" required></label><label class="field hermes-checkbox"><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" ${value.enabled?'checked':''}><span><strong>Enable middleware connector</strong><small>Deployments can select Hermes only when this is enabled.</small></span></label><div class="wide section-kicker hermes-policy-kicker">Hermes AI model connector</div><p class="wide subtle">These values are used by the local NousResearch Hermes process for this platform. The API key is encrypted at rest and is never returned to the browser.</p><label class="field">Model name<input name="modelName" value="${escape(model.modelName||'')}" placeholder="Provider model ID"></label><label class="field">Model endpoint / base URL<input name="modelServiceUrl" type="url" value="${escape(model.serviceUrl||'')}" placeholder="https://provider.example/v1"></label><label class="field">Model API key<input name="modelApiKey" type="password" placeholder="${model.hasApiKey?'Encrypted model key saved — leave blank to retain':'Enter model API key'}"></label><label class="field">Model API timeout (seconds)<input name="modelTimeoutSeconds" type="number" min="30" max="600" value="${escape(model.timeoutSeconds||180)}" required><span>Maximum time Hermes waits for this model provider per request.</span></label><div class="wide detail-actions"><button type="button" class="quiet" data-test-hermes-model>Test model</button><button type="button" class="quiet" data-test-hermes-middleware>Health check</button><button class="primary">Save Hermes middleware settings</button></div></form><div class="notice compact-notice"><strong>Generic contract:</strong> POST the authorized request envelope to the middleware endpoint and return <code>{ requestId, status, content, model, trace, toolCalls, memoryEvents, usage, error }</code>. Middleware output is untrusted and validated before delivery.</div></section>`;
